Here is a simple Java program that reads a string from the user and prints it in reverse:

```java
import java.util.Scanner;

public class ReverseString {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);

        System.out.print("Enter a string: ");
        String input = scanner.nextLine();

        StringBuilder reversed = new StringBuilder(input);
        String reversedString = reversed.reverse().toString();

        System.out.println("Reversed string: " + reversedString);

        scanner.close();
    }
}
```

This code uses `StringBuilder`'s `reverse()` method to efficiently reverse the string.
